cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "ERIS: Evidence Recovery Inference Suite"
message: "If you use this suite, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Indwar
    given-names: Abhaydeep
    email: abhayindwar7@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/indwar7/eris-ml"
abstract: >-
  Five adversarially-hardened machine-learning benchmarks for latent-process
  recovery, in which every label is a fact recorded by an external archive or
  measured from a real model run, rather than a human annotation or a model
  output. Each benchmark ships a sealed answer key, a deterministic grader, a
  runnable reference solution, and a measured baseline ladder including
  adversarial shortcut attacks scored before the specification was frozen.
keywords:
  - benchmark
  - natural language processing
  - evaluation
  - latent structure recovery
  - dataset
  - retrieval-augmented generation
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-21"
